00:00:19.703 --> 00:00:23.640
And we're going to be
talking about counting.

00:00:23.741 --> 00:00:26.744
And we're going to be talking
about the mul which is a way

00:00:26.844 --> 00:00:29.413
to count to help us count.

00:00:29.513 --> 00:00:32.316
And then-- and this
is really exciting--

00:00:32.415 --> 00:00:33.684
we're going to be building this.

00:00:33.784 --> 00:00:34.852
And that is super exciting.

00:00:34.952 --> 00:00:36.220
Now, everybody
should have gotten

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:39.423
one of these on
the first day when

00:00:39.523 --> 00:00:41.458
we talk about this
later in the lecture.

00:00:41.558 --> 00:00:44.828
If you don't have this,
and for that matter--

00:00:44.928 --> 00:00:45.863
oh, there's Laura.

00:00:45.963 --> 00:00:48.332
Laura has like
