00:25:31.847 --> 00:25:35.818
And if you light a candle, and
you're taken 10 to the 2 times

00:25:35.918 --> 00:25:37.887
into 20 the molecules of
candle out of the year,

00:25:37.987 --> 00:25:41.056
by the way, how many molecules
of oxygen are you burning?

00:25:46.629 --> 00:25:50.332
Ah, how many
molecules of oxygen?

00:25:50.432 --> 00:25:54.670
Ha, for at 38, balance--

00:25:54.770 --> 00:25:57.873
38 times as many molecules.

00:25:57.973 --> 00:25:59.275
For each one of
