00:26:30.072 --> 00:26:31.540
You need that.

00:26:31.640 --> 00:26:32.908
I mean, maybe it's variable.

00:26:33.008 --> 00:26:34.009
But you need roughly--

00:26:34.109 --> 00:26:34.944
and there's two of you.

