00:26:54.363 --> 00:26:57.032
0 point-- who's going to win--

00:26:57.132 --> 00:26:59.668
you or the candle?

00:26:59.768 --> 00:27:02.037
So you got to be
just aware of this.

00:27:02.137 --> 00:27:08.310
And now look, This is kind
of thing we can do now.

